# Trivy findings accepted for this demo. Each is a deliberate choice, compared with production
# in docs/deploy/production-differences.md. Any finding not listed here fails CI.

# Security groups allow all egress. Hosts need HTTPS to ECR, SSM, Let's Encrypt and Docker
# registries; tight egress needs VPC endpoints (about $7 a month each). See "Outbound traffic
# unrestricted".
AVD-AWS-0104

# CloudTrail and the log bucket use AWS-managed encryption (SSE-S3), not a customer managed KMS
# key: a CMK costs $1 a month plus requests, and its value is cross-account key control, which
# belongs to the separate log-archive account production would use.
AVD-AWS-0015
AVD-AWS-0132
